    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/93cb513dd054675518a7e6eb1859dcd4.webp?t=1746706872\" width=602 height=44 /></span><br>&quot;Undivine&quot; is a dark metroidvania with RPG elements that will challenge your courage and wits. Step into a world shrouded in mystery and desolation, where every corner hides dangers and ancient secrets. The world of Undivine is filled with relics, items, NPCs, bosses, secrets, and much more, all waiting to be discovered. It's a world ready for you to explore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/f4037b7b9f811ef80169d549eaed2e65.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>Known only as &quot;the traveler,&quot; you arrive at the outskirts of a desolate village. The people there live in fear of a giant hole that has opened in the middle of the village, swallowing most of its residents. Brave warriors have attempted to venture into the chasm, but none have returned. With no other choice, you descend into the abyss, only to find a vast, interconnected world filled with mysteries and mysticism. It is up to you to uncover its secrets. Will you be able to face the one behind it all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/7bcd544458cdd11b1b84f36e2e3ae4f8.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>Combat in Undivine is fast and satisfying. Use everything at your disposal to face the many enemies you will encounter. Relics, swords, armor, and accessories\u2014all have unique features that will change the way you play the game. Combine sword attacks with the powers of your Relics to execute combos and escape from enemies' attacks. Find the best combination that suits your playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/65aa740cd37e9300bf459f77a782807d.poster.avif?t=1746706872\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/65aa740cd37e9300bf459f77a782807d.webm?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/65aa740cd37e9300bf459f77a782807d.mp4?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/ac5632c27d678e99b54d43e51100dac9.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>&quot;Undivine&quot; plays like a classic metroidvania. You will start with only the ability to jump and attack with your sword, but as you make your way through the Realm, you'll find relics that grant you various abilities. These abilities will be useful not only in combat but also in traversing the Realm and overcoming its many dangers. At your disposal is also a talent system, where you can improve your skills in alchemy, demonology, cartography, and many others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/3289d48a188286c5a931077ec615802a.poster.avif?t=1746706872\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/3289d48a188286c5a931077ec615802a.webm?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/3289d48a188286c5a931077ec615802a.mp4?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/4e4c69f0ef36cb0b6dabd67b340f7d5e.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>You choose how you will play &quot;Undivine.&quot; You are not required to unlock every skill to reach the end of the game; on the contrary, most of what the game has to offer is entirely optional.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/12012007c9d15aa4295a923b3700c275.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=44 /></span><br><br>&quot;Undivine&quot; respects every playstyle and will reward you accordingly as you progress. The world of &quot;Undivine&quot; was designed to let you explore its interconnected regions the way you like - there is no correct way to explore and to progress. See if you can find all 30 unique collectibles, which not only tell stories from the world of &quot;Undivine&quot; but also reference other games that inspired its creation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/dd0dac93f210937d064c8d3f51759a6a.poster.avif?t=1746706872\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/dd0dac93f210937d064c8d3f51759a6a.webm?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/dd0dac93f210937d064c8d3f51759a6a.mp4?t=1746706872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/19f33edfa8527f5848cc99e131dce6f9.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Freedom of exploration - Undivine's interconnected world is not linear, explore at your own pace;<br></li><li> Rewarding progress - the more you explore, more you will discover and unlock;<br></li><li> Relics - unlock special abilities that will change your entire gameplay experience;<br></li><li> Side quests - find rewarding and story-rich secondary missions;<br></li><li> Satisfying combat - use your weapon combined with your special powers;<br></li><li> Rich inventory - find weapons, armors, accessories and many items to help in your journey;<br></li><li> Talent system - increase your proficiency in alchemy, demonology, dexterity, cartography and many more;<br></li><li> Three levels of difficulty - Undivine can adapt to all player skill levels, without losing it's core features;<br></li><li> Additional content - lots of optional content, including weapons, abilities, talents, relics, NPC interactions and more;</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/93cb513dd054675518a7e6eb1859dcd4.webp?t=1746706872\" width=602 height=44 /></span><br>&quot;Undivine&quot; is a dark metroidvania with RPG elements that will challenge your courage and wits. Step into a world shrouded in mystery and desolation, where every corner hides dangers and ancient secrets. The world of Undivine is filled with relics, items, NPCs, bosses, secrets, and much more, all waiting to be discovered. It's a world ready for you to explore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/f4037b7b9f811ef80169d549eaed2e65.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>Known only as &quot;the traveler,&quot; you arrive at the outskirts of a desolate village. The people there live in fear of a giant hole that has opened in the middle of the village, swallowing most of its residents. Brave warriors have attempted to venture into the chasm, but none have returned. With no other choice, you descend into the abyss, only to find a vast, interconnected world filled with mysteries and mysticism. It is up to you to uncover its secrets. Will you be able to face the one behind it all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087910/extras/7bcd544458cdd11b1b84f36e2e3ae4f8.webp?t=1746706872\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br>Combat in Undivine is fast and satisfying. Use everything at your disposal to face the many enemies you will encounter. Relics, swords, armor, and accessories\u2014all have unique features that will change the way you play the game. Combine sword attacks with the powers of your Relics to execute combos and escape from enemies' attacks. Find the best combination that suits your playstyle.<br><br><span cla