your own pace;<br></li><li> Rewarding progress - the more you explore, more you will discover and unlock;<br></li><li> Relics - unlock special abilities that will change your entire gameplay experience;<br></li><li> Side quests - find rewarding and story-rich secondary missions;<br></li><li> Satisfying combat - use your weapon combined with your special powers;<br></li><li> Rich inventory - find weapons, armors, accessories and many items to help in your journey;<br></li><li> Talent system - increase your proficiency in alchemy, demonology, dexterity, cartography and many more;<br></li><li> Three levels of difficulty - Undivine can adapt to all player skill levels, without losing it's core features;<br></li><li> Additional content - lots of optional content, including weapons, abilities, talents, relics, NPC interactions and more;</li></ul>",
